.TH AILX-BENCH 1 "2026-11-27" "ailx 0.1" "AI Linux"
.SH NAME
ailx-bench \- reproducible benchmark campaigns for local AI workloads
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ailx-bench
[\fB\-\-store\fR \fIDIR\fR] \fICOMMAND\fR ...
.SH DESCRIPTION
Commands: \fBprobe\fR, \fBrun\fR, \fBcampaign\fR plan|run|analyze|all, \fBreport\fR,
\fBstore\fR verify|list, \fBpower\fR, \fBquality\fR reference|evaluate, \fBvalidate\-claims\fR,
\fBtelemetry\fR check. Campaigns are pre-registered, run in randomized interleaved order and
analysed with nonparametric statistics; simulated results are always labeled.
.SH SEE ALSO
ailx(1)
